{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"{den} -- I think, that's where I saw them last, don't go, please, don't go","They're at {den}, it's an awful place, I hear screams sometimes, even from here","I don't know exactly, but I've heard it's {den}, that's where they hold the people they take","Near {den}, that's all I know, and I'd rather not know any more"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Last I heard... they set up at {den}, lots of guns, lots of guards","{den}, but don't go alone, don't go at all, if you value your life","They move around, but mostly they hang at {den}, tire tracks everywhere, broken glass","There's a rumor about {den}, I can't confirm, but the stories are consistent"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why you asking? You looking to get yourself hurt?","I don't know where they are, and I don't want to know","Why do you want to know where they are? You one of them? Back up","I'm not giving directions to strangers, if they find out I talked, they'll burn my house down"}},
{"ASK_DEN","role=civilian_loner",{"Followed their trucks to {den}, once, from a distance, never again"}},
{"ASK_DEN","role=militia",{"{den} is on our watch list, we avoid it, and we've lost two men near there"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"{den}, but be careful, it's well guarded, and I don't want you hurt","Last I heard, they're at {den}, and you know the risks","{den}, I'd bet my life on it, and I hope you don't have to bet yours","I know it's {den}, I've seen their smoke from the ridge","If you're going, go smart, {den} is a trap for the unwary","You didn't hear it from me, but it's {den}","{den}, near enough, and there's no good way in","I won't stop you, but {den} is no place for the faint of heart","It's {den}, and I'd come with you, if I weren't needed here","Word is, they hole up at {den}, so, think twice","{den}, and the guard changes at dusk, I'm told","I'd say {den}, but don't take my word as gospel","They're at {den}, and they don't take prisoners!!","{den}, and watch for tripwires","I'll tell you, because I trust you: {den}","It's {den}, a bad place, with worse people","{den} -- but don't go alone, please","The trail leads to {den} -- I saw it myself!","I heard {den}, from two different people, so, probably true","Their hideout is {den}, the worst-kept secret around","I'll say it once: {den}","{den}, and may God go with you","If I had a gun, I'd go with you to {den}","I can't be sure, but {den} is my best guess","It's {den}, and it's not pretty","{den}, as far as I know, and I know too much","Believe it or don't: {den}!","They've been seen coming and going from {den}","{den}, down a ways, you'll smell it before you see it","There's a light at {den}, every night, a lamp in the window","{den}, and good luck, you'll need it"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"{den}? Why do you want to know? You planning to join them?","Don't ask me about {den}","I won't TELL you where {den} is, or isn't","If I knew, you'd be the last I'd tell","Ask your friends at {den}","{den}? Maybe -- maybe not, you tell me!!","You want {den}? Walk in a circle until you find it!","I'd sooner burn a map than draw one for you","Stay away from {den} -- and from me","I won't be responsible for what happens at {den}","Go find {den} yourself, you probably already know the way","I wouldn't trust you with the time of day","You might be one of theirs, for all I know","Not a word about {den}, NOT from me","I don't point strangers at trouble, and you're trouble","They'd be happy to see you at {den}, I bet","Why ask me? You seem to know your way around trouble","I can't help you find {den}, and I wouldn't","Look elsewhere, there's plenty of ditches","I'll tell you where {den} isn't: anywhere near me","If you want to join them, find your own door","I don't have the energy to lie to you!!","Is that a threat? Because it sounds like a threat","I know NOTHING, I saw nothing, I said nothing","Go away, and take {den} with you","You come here asking for {den}? Funny","If it's {den} you're after -- you won't need a guide","I'm done talking about {den}","Believe whatever you like, I'm NOT telling","Search high, search low, search far from me","You can't be serious!"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"{den}, but forget that, forget that, we've got our own problems","{den}? Later, later, there are worse things here","Not now! Dens, raiders, who cares, THEY'RE here"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"{den}... and with that in your hands you might even clear it.."}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Where are the robbers? Right here, friend, hello","Hideout? I'm not telling you that, not in a thousand years","If you're asking where the raiders are, you're about to find out","Every crew has a place, and none of them tell strangers, think about it","You want {den}? Go ahead and try, see what happens"}},
{"ASK_DEN","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Their hideout is the last place you'll ever see, keep asking"}},
