{"ASK_DEN","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"They killed my friend, I saw them go into {den} - please don't tell them I told you, okay?","I think they're at {den}, I heard shooting from there last night, and somebody screaming - I didn't go look - I'm sorry","My brother followed them to {den}, he came back without his truck and without his shoes"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
