{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"{destination}... I think? Heard it's safe, then I heard that about three other places too!","Toward {destination}, my sister's that way, if the road's open, God, please let it be open","{destination}, wherever that is from here, I've got a map, but my hands keep shaking","I'm going to {destination}, and don't say it's a bad idea, I already know it's a bad idea!","Heading for {destination}... someone on the radio said there were soldiers, and that's all I've got","{destination}, to find my husband, he's at work there, or he was, he HAS to be","I don't know, honestly, away, anywhere that isn't this, does that make sense?","Home, if I can get there. I keep trying to think of somewhere else and coming up empty","Nowhere, I just keep moving - if I stop I start thinking, and then I can't move","Away from the town, I couldn't stay, there were too many, too many of them","Anywhere with a lock, then I'll figure out the next part, one lock at a time","I've got an aunt, she's got a farm, if I can get there... I just have to get there","Out of here, that's all, I'll take wherever the ground lets me stand","To find my kids, and if you try to stop me I'll- no, I'm sorry, I won't do anything, I just need to find my kids"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,4",{"{destination}... the TV said to go to the shelters, so that's where I'm going, the TV wouldn't lie, would it","Home, everyone says stay put, but I can't, I'm gonna go see if my mother's okay","I'm waiting for the Guard... someone said they'd be through, I'm just waiting by the road"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"{destination}, there's a few people there, we trade, I'm bringing what I scrounged","Not far, I check on a woman who lives alone, her husband died, I bring her what I can","Back to the group, I was gone too long, they'll be worried, or they'll be mad, probably both...","Just looking, I walk every day, I look for food, I look for people, I look for a reason","Nowhere in particular -- I follow the quiet, the quiet's where I live now","{destination}, we heard there were fewer of them that way, we'll see","Same place I always go, back, it's not far, you'll forgive me if I don't say more"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=friendly",{"{destination} - come along if you want, I won't promise it's safe","Heading toward {destination}, and I could use the company, honestly","Toward {destination}, I'll tell you what I know about the way if you're headed there too"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"That's not your concern -- and I'd appreciate it if you stopped asking!","Away from you, if that's alright","None of your business, I'm leaving, so, thank you","I'm going somewhere you're not, how's that","Wherever I'm going, you're NOT invited"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_loner",{"{destination}, ten miles through the trees, the long way, because the short way's got company","Following the ridge, no roads, I don't like to be seen","Don't know yet... I go where the game goes, and the game's moved..","Nowhere in a hurry, you do that long enough and you stop wanting a destination","Wherever the next water is, that's it, that's the plan","Back to my place, I left something burning, no, I mean I left a pot on, hold on, I'm joking","{destination}, to check a trap line, and then, who knows","West, mostly, I like the sunsets, and I don't like the sunrise, that's all the reason I need","Out of your hair, if you don't mind","Toward {destination}... I heard there's a man selling lamp oil, I need lamp oil, you'd be surprised how much","North... until I hit water, then east, then I'll see.."}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"Away from you -- don't follow!!","My business, my road!"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=family_man,family_woman,family_elder,family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"We're trying to get to my in-laws in {destination}, it's farther than I'd like, but they have a well","Home, the kids are there, I've been out two days looking for medicine, and I'm sorry, but I've gotta go","{destination}, because my cousin said it's quiet, and we need quiet more than anything","Just back to the house, we're not going far, we can't go far, we've got a baby","Toward {destination}, a church group's running a shelter, I think, I hope","Grandma's place... she's got the cellar, the pantry, and a shotgun older than me","We don't know, honestly, we're looking for somewhere with room for the whole family","Wherever there's food, that's where we're going, my kids haven't eaten since yesterday","Back to the farm, we need to feed the animals, we can't just leave them"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=family_elder",{"Nowhere, honey, these knees won't take me past the mailbox, I'm only walking so my legs don't forget","To see my sister, she's three streets over, she's the only one left, I've got to know she's alright","Home, I'm taking the long way, because I'm scared of the short way","{destination}, to church, the doors are open, they've got a pot of soup going"}},
