{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=worker",{"Back to the shop, I've got tools there, and a cot, and a lock that works","{destination}, they've got a generator at the plant, and food in the cafeteria","Making a run, supplies for the crew, we're low on salt, can you imagine, SALT","Back to my truck, hold on, I don't have a truck, forget it, I'm just walking, alright?","Over to {destination}, to see if the rail yard has anything we can use","I've got a delivery, funny, huh, old habit, but I'm still moving things from one place to another"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=worker|st=careful",{"Not far from here, and it's not for you","That's between me and the road","Work"}},
{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=rescue_medical",{"Back to my patients, there's four of them back there, one is not gonna make it, but I have to be there","{destination}, I heard they need nurses, and I can't just sit here, I can't, I need to do something","Home, to my kids, then back to work, as soon as I know they're alright, I give you my word- I mean it","To the next person who needs me, that's where I'm always going, it's the only direction","Looking for antibiotics, any, all, whatever they've got, and if I have to break every lock in the county, I will"}},
