{"ASK_DESTINATION","role=rescue_clergy",{"Where I'm needed, there's always someone on the road in need of a word or a hand","{destination}, there's a family there who lost their father, I promised I'd come","To the church, to unlock it, so people have somewhere to go in the daytime","Wherever the Lord sends me, today that's {destination}, and my feet are not looking forward to it","To bury someone, I'm sorry, that's all I can say, it's what I do now"}},
