{"ASK_DIRECTIONS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"{town}? Oh... that's a hike, and I wouldn't try it on foot, not without a map and a miracle","{town}? I haven't been that way since before, I couldn't tell you what's between here and there","I've heard it's rough, {town}, a lot of the dead, a lot of fires, I'd think twice","{town}? Long way around, skip the main road and the bridge, and don't trust anybody too friendly","No idea, honestly, I never learned the roads, I always had someone drive me","You'd better ask someone who's been there lately, I can't send you into that blind","{town}... hmm, that's a day's walk, maybe two, if you're quick and lucky, and I don't like your odds","{town}? I wouldn't, but if you must, go slow, stay off the roads, and bring a friend","Past the water tower, then turn at the church, I think, I could be wrong, don't quote me","I've never been to {town}, but I hear it's lovely, or it was, or it will be, I don't know"}},
{"ASK_DIRECTIONS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"{town}? That way, and don't come back","Figure it out, I'm not a tour guide!","I don't give directions to strangers, folks follow you right back the same way","{destination}'s that way, so you go that way, and I'll go this way"}},
{"ASK_DIRECTIONS","role=civilian_loner",{"{town}? I know a back way... through the woods, across the creek, it's longer, but safer...","Follow the power lines, they run straight there, you won't get lost"}},
