{"ASK_DIRECTIONS","role=militia",{"{town}? That's inside the cordon, or outside, I can't remember, check with the sheriff"}},
{"ASK_DIRECTIONS","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"{town}? Sure, I'll tell you, take the first road, then the next, you can't miss it, easy","{town} is that way, probably, who cares if I'm wrong, you're the one walking","Directions cost extra, you got anything shiny?","{town}, it's far, and every mile is full of people like me","You want {town}? Walk until you hit something that bites, then turn around"}},
